    {"a": "DeSTSeg", "t": "longtail", "aka": ["denoising student-teacher segmentation", "segmentation guided denoising student-teacher"], "q": "A denoising student matches a frozen teacher, then a segmentation net fuses their gaps. Zhang et al., CVPR 2023."},
